1
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:09,260
(Howard:)And now the
kung pao chicken.

2
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:10,650
(Leonard:)Ah, yeah.
Wow.

3
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:12,070
(Raj:)Smooth.

4
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:13,950
(Howard:)And finally,

5
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:15,790
(Howard:)my moo shu pork.

6
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:18,870
(Raj:)Whoo-hoo!

7
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:20,630
Oh, there you have
it, gentlemen.

8
00:00:20,630 --> 00:00:24,800
(Howard:)Our entire dinner
unpacked by robot.

9
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:27,180
(Raj:)And it only took 28 minutes.

10
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:29,280
(Sheldon:)Impressive,

11
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:31,650
(Sheldon:)but we must be cautious.
Why?

12
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:34,640
(Sheldon:)Today, it's a Chinese food
retrieval robot.

13
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:37,180
(Sheldon:)Tomorrow,
it travels back in time

14
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:39,680
(Sheldon:)and tries to kill Sarah Connor.

15
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:41,980
(Leonard:)I don't think that's
going to happen, Sheldon.

16
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:43,370
(Sheldon:)No one ever does.

17
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:44,980
(Sheldon:)That's why it happens.

18
00:00:45,990 --> 00:00:47,700
(Penny(arriving):)Hey. Is the food here?

19
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:49,000
(Penny(arriving):)Ooh. What's that?

20
00:00:49,010 --> 00:00:50,270
(Howard:)That, dear lady,

21
00:00:50,270 --> 00:00:52,920
(Howard:)is the Wolowitz
Programmable Hand,

22
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:54,590
(Howard:)designed
for extravehicular repairs

23
00:00:54,590 --> 00:00:57,050
(Howard:)on the International
Space Station.

24
00:00:57,050 --> 00:00:58,630
(Penny:)Ah, cool.

25
00:00:58,630 --> 00:01:00,330
(Howard:)Ask me to pass the soy sauce.

26
00:01:00,330 --> 00:01:03,100
(Penny:)Oh, does that come up much
on the space station?

